Z||000000||CoolBlue87GT||10-11-2001||03:17 PM||||Warning **** For those that have this wax ***<P>At one of the latest shows,they handed out a wax named "KARDOL Fine cut Compound" or KARDOL Finishing wax" that was in a spray can. (see pic below)<P>DO NOT USE THIS WAX !!  -- PER THE KARDOL COMPANY !!  <P>If you have this, do yourself a favor and throw it out.  <P>I just got off the phone with them. That product was last made in 1990, and they said over this lenth of time, the chemicals would break down and not perform well.<P>They were surprised that someone still had some, and said I was the first to inquire about that product in about 10 years !<P>It make's it very hard to remove from paint. - Almost impossible ! <P>I tried it on my other car. -- geee, what a mistake. Had to use a wax remover to get it off.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/delwax.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 10-11-2001).]||||reg||4
